|Description={{en|This 2k file is a multiple example for following ''hints'':
# '''PNG''' is a very flexible format.
# In case you have to display text as pixel graphics, PNG will do best.
# Reduce number of colours to reduce filesize.
# Furthermore use a PNG compression tool.
# Even the humblest example can be made something special, if you want. 

This elaborate ''piece of art'' may be used for tracking test edits, amongst others. Such use is however no reason to use a boring design.}}
